  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IOM: Fredsavtalets system f&#xF6;r &#xF6;verg&#xE5;ngsr&#xE4;ttvisa</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM: Peace Agreement&#xB4;s transitional justice system - Support for the Peace Agreement&#xB4;s TJ System NS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Outcome: Contribute to the implementation of the Transitional Justice system (SIVJRNR) and promote the participation of victims and civil society in the system.

Output 1:Entities and mechanisms of the SIVJRNR have technical and financial capacity to perform their duties. 

Output 2: Civil society and victims have capacity and information for their participation in the SIVJRNR 

Output 3: The Government and Civil Society have capacities for the formulation and development of trust building actions within the implementation of the Peace Agreement.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta &#xE4;r ett st&#xF6;d till ett IOM-program med titeln &quot;Fredsavtalets system f&#xF6;r &#xF6;verg&#xE5;ngsr&#xE4;ttvisa&#x201D;. Syftet &#xE4;r att st&#xF6;dja det system f&#xF6;r &#xF6;verg&#xE5;ngsr&#xE4;ttvisa (SIVJRNR, f&#xF6;rkortning p&#xE5; spanska) som uppr&#xE4;ttades i samband med fredsavtalet som ingicks mellan den colombianska regeringen och FARC-gerillan, samt att fr&#xE4;mja offrens och det civila samh&#xE4;llets deltagande i detta system. Programmet fungerar som en fond som st&#xF6;der projekt med syftet att: (i) St&#xE4;rka institutionerna och mekanismerna f&#xF6;r &#xF6;verg&#xE5;ngsr&#xE4;ttvisa inom SIVJRNR; (ii) Fr&#xE4;mja det civila samh&#xE4;llets och offrens deltagande i SIVJRNR; och (iii) St&#xF6;dja f&#xF6;rtroendeskapande &#xE5;tg&#xE4;rder mellan regeringen, FARC och det civila samh&#xE4;llet.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a support to a specific-purpose programme and fund managed by IOM, titled &#x201C;Programme for the support of the Peace Agreement&#x2019;s Transitional Justice System&#x201D;. The purpose is to support the Transitional Justice System (SIVJRNR for its acronym in Spanish) created through the Peace Agreement between the Colombian government and the FARC guerrilla, as well as to promote the participation of victims and civil society within that system. The Programme acts as a fund supporting projects oriented towards: (i) Strengthening the transitional justice institutions and mechanisms within the SIVJRNR; (ii) Promoting the participation of civil society and victims in the SIVJRNR; and (iii) Supporting trust-building measures between the Government, the FARC, and civil society.</narrative>
  </description>
